---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---

<Base
  title="tycs — Learn CS by Building"
  description="Master computer science fundamentals by building real systems in Go. Write a key-value store, measure it against a reference implementation, iterate until yours is faster."
>
  <section aria-labelledby="hero-heading" class="py-16 px-6 md:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1
        id="hero-heading"
        class="text-display font-bold text-foreground leading-tight max-w-3xl mx-auto"
      >
        Build real systems. Measure your code against a reference. Ship when it passes.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 text-body text-muted-foreground max-w-[720px] mx-auto">
        tycs teaches computer science through implementation. You write Go programs that solve real problems — a key-value store, a scheduler, a network protocol — and benchmark them against reference implementations.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a
          href="https://app.mycscompanion.dev/sign-in"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold rounded-lg min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] px-8 py-3 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
        >
          <span class="hidden md:inline">Start Building</span>
          <span class="md:hidden">Open on desktop to build</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="value-heading" class="py-16 px-6 md:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <h2
        id="value-heading"
        class="text-h1 font-semibold text-foreground text-center"
      >
        What you build, how you measure it
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <article class="bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
          <h3 class="text-h2 font-semibold text-foreground">Write real code</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-body text-muted-foreground">
            Each milestone is a complete system — not a toy exercise. You implement data structures, algorithms, and protocols in Go with a full editor and terminal.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
          <h3 class="text-h2 font-semibold text-foreground">Benchmark against a reference</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-body text-muted-foreground">
            Your implementation runs against structured workloads. Results are compared to a reference implementation so you can see exactly where your code stands.
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="bg-card rounded-lg p-6 border border-border">
          <h3 class="text-h2 font-semibold text-foreground">Iterate until it passes</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-body text-muted-foreground">
            Acceptance criteria are concrete and measurable. You know exactly what your code needs to do. No subjective grading — your implementation either meets the spec or it does not.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a
          href="https://app.mycscompanion.dev/sign-in"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold rounded-lg min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] px-8 py-3 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
        >
          <span class="hidden md:inline">Start Building</span>
          <span class="md:hidden">Open on desktop to build</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section aria-labelledby="preview-heading" class="py-16 px-6 md:px-8">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2
        id="preview-heading"
        class="text-h1 font-semibold text-foreground"
      >
        Milestone 1: Key-Value Store
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body text-muted-foreground max-w-[720px] mx-auto">
        Your first milestone: implement a concurrent key-value store in Go. Handle reads, writes, and deletes under load. Benchmark your throughput against the reference.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10">
        <a
          href="https://app.mycscompanion.dev/sign-in"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold rounded-lg min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] px-8 py-3 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
        >
          <span class="hidden md:inline">Start Building</span>
          <span class="md:hidden">Open on desktop to build</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div slot="footer" class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 py-12">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <p class="text-body-sm text-muted-foreground">
        tycs — Computer science through implementation
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://app.mycscompanion.dev/sign-in"
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-semibold rounded-lg min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] px-8 py-3 focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-ring"
      >
        <span class="hidden md:inline">Start Building</span>
        <span class="md:hidden">Open on desktop to build</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-border flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <p class="text-caption text-muted-foreground">
        &copy; {new Date().getFullYear()} tycs
      </p>
      <nav aria-label="Footer navigation">
        <a
          href="https://app.mycscompanion.dev/privacy"
          class="text-caption text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground transition-colors"
        >
          Privacy Policy
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
